('ScoutD2Quote','scout',"Independently reopen D2 live and capture; use the capture tool's extractor to verify exact 5-word Gate quote, 17-word attribution anchor (folded vs verbatim), PDF p4/journal p114, quote-page/window-pages and same-page capture. Report hashes/commands."),
('ScoutBaseNames','scout','Independent broad base ground sweep: search corpus/knowledge all six partitions for 姓/名 succession, Chinese naming periodization, plant/flower lexemes in female Chinese names, 88/17 counts; inspect hits rather than relying on grep alone. Return full command/output and any counterexample.'),
